your specific major or area of interest. Learn interview skills and quick and efficient strategies to stand out. You will secure your desired role with limitless opportunities to practice answering all types of interview questions in a low-pressure environment. Join Big Interview Image Score GOLD with Big Resume’s expert-backed AI toolkit for strategic, personalized applications. Learn how to craft targeted resumes and cover letters that showcase your strengths, match the job requirements, and present you as a standout candidate. Big Resume’s features are built to get results: Resume AI (scan your resume for instant, personalized feedback), Resume Builder (get templates and expert tips on creating your resume), Cover Letter Generator (AI helps you write professional drafts based on your resume and job description), and a video-based Resume Curriculum. Join Big Resume via Big Interview Understanding ResumeAI Career & Major Exploration Image Create your unique PathwayU account to gain a competitive edge and to find meaning and purpose in life and work. PathwayU helps with self-discovery, career exploration, and job connection along your education journey. Take the Assessment What Can I Do With This Major? Image Review 100 major profiles with information on common career paths, types of employers that hire in the field, and strategies to maximize opportunities. Scroll to the bottom of each profile for links to professional associations, occupational outlook information, and job search resources. Explore Career Paths Explore Job Titles Micro Internships & Virtual Gigs Image With Parker Dewey, students from all majors can complete professional assignments to build and demonstrate skills while exploring a variety of career paths. Students Employers Image Forage's creative Virtual Experience Programs help students build real-world skills directly from leading organizations. Students Educators 1615 Stanley Street CT 06050 Directions 860.832.3200 Central Facebook Central Twi